Subject: Add Pattern X constructor wrapping + Date/Function/Error overrides
 (Batch 17: 10 APIs)

New infrastructure: GenericConstructorWrapper, WrapConstructorOnGlobal,
WrapSymbolFunctionOnObject. Date constructor + valueOf + Symbol.toPrimitive,
Function.prototype.toString, Error/TypeError/RangeError/SyntaxError constructors,
Notification + FontFace constructors.

